          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, Mwenyezi-Mungu anangoja awafadhili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyi watu wa Siyoni, enyi watu wa Yerusalemu, hakika nyinyi hamtaomboleza tena. Kweli Mungu atawahurumia; mara tu atakaposikia kilio chenu atawaitikeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingawa Bwana atawalisha taabu na kuwanywesha dhiki, yeye ndiye Mwalimu wenu na hatajificha tena; nanyi mtamwona kwa macho yenu wenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkienda kulia au kushoto, mtasikia sauti nyuma yenu ikisema, “Njia ni hii; ifuateni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtavifanya haramu vinyago vyenu vya miungu vilivyopakwa fedha na sanamu zenu zilizopakwa dhahabu. Mtazitupilia mbali kama vitu najisi, mkisema, “Poteleeni mbali!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtakapopanda mbegu zenu, Mwenyezi-Mungu atanyesha mvua kwa wakati wake, nazo zitakua na kuwapa mavuno mengi. Mifugo yenu nayo itapata malisho kwa wingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafahali na punda wenu wa kulimia watapata malisho yaliyochambuliwa vizuri na kutiwa chumvi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati utakapofika ambapo maadui watauawa na ngome zao kubomolewa, vijito vya maji vitatiririka kutoka kila mlima na kilima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena mwezi utawaka kama jua, nao mwanga wa jua utakuwa mara saba ya mwanga wake wa kawaida, kana kwamba mwanga wa siku saba umeangaza katika siku moja. Mambo haya yote yatatukia wakati Mwenyezi-Mungu atakapoyafunga na kuyaponya majeraha aliyowaletea watu wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini nyinyi watu wa Yerusalemu mtaimba kwa furaha kama mfanyavyo wakati wa mkesha wa sikukuu. Mtajaa furaha kama watu wanaotembea kwa mdundo wa muziki wa filimbi kwenda mlimani kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mwamba wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu atawafanya watu wote waisikie sauti yake tukufu na pigo la nguvu yake lionekane kwa hasira nyingi. Kutakuwa na ndimi za moto mkali, ngurumo, dhoruba na mvua ya mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waashuru watajaa hofu watakaposikia sauti ya Mwenyezi-Mungu wakati atakapowachapa na fimbo yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila pigo la adhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu juu ya Waashuru litaandamana na mdundo wa ngoma na zeze. Yeye mwenyewe binafsi atapigana na Waashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, mahali pa kumteketeza mfalme wa Ashuru pamekwisha tayarishwa muda mrefu uliopita. Mahali penyewe ni shimo kubwa na pana. Moto upo na kuni kwa wingi. Mwenyezi-Mungu ataupulizia pumzi yake kama kijito cha madini ya kiberiti na kuuwasha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
